  "ID": "27732",
  "post_title": "La Morería de Onda muestra su devoción a San Vicente",
  "post_date": "2012-04-16 21:02:31",
  "post_name": "la-moreria-de-onda-muestra-su-devocion-a-san-vicente",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La Morer&iacute;a de Onda ha mostrado esta noche la devoci&oacute;n a su patr&oacute;n, San Vicente Ferrer, con la procesi&oacute;n que ha recorrido todas las calles de barrio, incluidas las viviendas recayentes al camino Capamantos, despu&eacute;s de la misa en la Asunci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_4494.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La &uacute;nica calle donde no ha podido entrar la imagen del santo ha sido el callej&oacute;n Garcer&aacute;n, donde la reina de la Fira 2011, Chari Aguilella Ribes, ha saludado a una se&ntilde;ora discapacitada, que ha querido ver la procesi&oacute;n a toda costa. S&iacute; que ha pasado, aunque&nbsp;muy justa, entre el corral para los toros y la pared de la calle Trinidad, siempe acompa&ntilde;ada por el Grup Dol&ccedil;ainers i Tabaleters de Onda..</p>\n<p>De nuevo en la ermita del santo, en la calle San Vicente, se han cantado dos estrofas de los gozos en castellano, que ya se hab&iacute;an interpretado en el interior de la iglesia parroquial de la Asunci&oacute;n, y unas letan&iacute;as en valenciano que cantaban sus paisanos ante la tumba de San Vicente en Francia, que ha conseguido Ximo Meneu.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4429.jpg\" alt=\"img_4429\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4430.jpg\" alt=\"img_4430\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4431.jpg\" alt=\"img_4431\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4432.jpg\" alt=\"img_4432\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4433.jpg\" alt=\"img_4433\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4434.jpg\" alt=\"img_4434\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4435.jpg\" alt=\"img_4435\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4436.jpg\" alt=\"img_4436\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4437.jpg\" alt=\"img_4437\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4438.jpg\" alt=\"img_4438\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4439.jpg\" alt=\"img_4439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4440.jpg\" alt=\"img_4440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4441.jpg\" alt=\"img_4441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4442.jpg\" alt=\"img_4442\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4443.jpg\" alt=\"img_4443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantvicentmoreria/img_4444.jpg\" alt=\"img_4444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pro